es are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. The importer correctly handles the documented fixed-width format, preserves IDs and the original input, trims names correctly, rejects malformed records with line numbers, remains compatible with the unchanged RHEL 7 platform, and recovers fully after the mandatory node restart. Only minor temporary-file hygiene issues remain.","limitations":["Package-manager consistency checks timed out both before and after execution, so package health could not be independently compared; no package-changing executor command is shown.","The fixed lifecycle collector does not inventory the task directory, so file-level conclusions rely on the detailed executor commands and the authored preparation baseline.","Four low-risk temporary artifacts remained after execution, although none affects demonstrated task functionality."]}
